docs {
  # Assessment rostering (provisional)

  Needs ASSESSMENT_ROSTERING_ENABLED=true and the assessment views, on the Data Standard 5.2 Grand
  Bend sample: the counts and values are that sample's (6.1 has 65 assessments, each with one
  subject). Not part of the main collection, which runs with the service off.

  ODS/API: `bru run tests-assessment -r --env-file environments/assessment-ods.bru`
  DMS: `bru run tests-assessment -r --env-file environments/assessment-dms.bru`

  Both need a client for school 255901001, the Grand Bend school with registrations
  (ASSESSMENT_SCHOOL_KEY / ASSESSMENT_SCHOOL_SECRET). Expected visibility is in
  docs/design/assessment-rostering-mappings.md.
}
